DTSTAMP:20260811T095533Z
DTSTART:20260814T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre and JamPAC Entertainment present The H-T
	own Disco Show\, a live concert featuring disco hits from the 1970s. \nGue
	sts can boogie down to favorite hits from artists like The Bee Gees\, Donn
	a Summer\, KC and the Sunshine Band\, and more. \nBacked by the H-Town Orc
	hestra\, local vocalists will be belting out the best tunes of the era acc
	ompanied by a full local dance company. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outd
	oor Theatre \nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seati
	ng for popular evening shows usually requires a free assigned ticket reser
	ved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at
	 Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n
	 \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and
	 boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about
	 promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of o
	ur channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-h-town-disco-s
	how-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-h-town-disco-show-at-miller
	-outdoor-theatre/
LOCATION:Miller Outdoor Theatre\, 6000 Hermann Park Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 770
	30\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
